## 50-Module Business Management Application — Pre-Module Foundation

**Filename:** `CORE_USER_API_MASTER_DOCUMENTATION.md`  
**Scope:** Core application, users, authentication, authorization, shared services, Internal API, External API, security, operations and testing.  
**Architecture:** Modular Monolith.  
**Technology:** PHP 8.3+, SQLite, PDO SQLite, HTML5, CSS3 and Vanilla JavaScript.  
